    "text": "Let $R(G;k)$ denote the minimal $m$ such that if the edges of $K_m$ are $k$-coloured then there is a monochromatic copy of $G$. Is it true that $ R(T;k)\\leq kn+O(1) $ for any tree $T$ on $n$ vertices?",
